{"seq":2,"slug":"flaky-test-detection","title":"Flaky 测试检测与 AI 辅助修复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-testing/quality/flaky-test-detection","wordCount":1163,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"flaky-测试检测与-ai-辅助修复\">Flaky 测试检测与 AI 辅助修复</h1><p>Flaky 测试（不稳定测试）是测试套件最大的信任杀手。一个偶尔随机失败的测试，会让工程师开始质疑所有的失败信号——&quot;这次失败是真的 bug 还是又一个 Flaky？&quot;一旦&quot;再跑一次&quot;成为习惯，测试的红色警告就失去了意义。解决 Flaky 测试不只是提升 CI 通过率，而是恢复整个团队对测试信号的信任。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Flaky 测试</strong>（Flaky Test）：在代码未改变的情况下，多次运行结果不一致（有时通过、有时失败）的测试，是 CI 信号噪声的主要来源。</p>\n<p><strong>时序依赖</strong>（Timing Dependency）：测试依赖时间（<code>setTimeout</code>、<code>sleep</code>）而非确定性状态变化，导致在不同速度的机器上结果不同。</p>\n<p><strong>顺序依赖</strong>（Order Dependency）：测试依赖前一个测试留下的共享状态，当测试顺序改变时行为随之改变。</p>\n<p><strong>环境依赖</strong>（Environment Dependency）：测试结果依赖时区、随机数种子、文件系统状态等环境变量，导致跨环境不一致。</p>\n<p><strong>确定性等待</strong>（Deterministic Wait）：等待特定 DOM 状态、接口返回或事件触发，而非等待固定时间，是修复时序 Flaky 的核心模式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>根因类型</th>\n<th>触发场景</th>\n<th>AI 检测信号</th>\n<th>修复方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时序依赖</td>\n<td>CI 慢机器失败，本地通过</td>\n<td><code>setTimeout</code> / <code>sleep</code> 模式</td>\n<td>改为确定性等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顺序依赖</td>\n<td>打乱顺序运行时失败</td>\n<td>全局变量/共享状态访问</td>\n<td>每个测试独立 setup</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境依赖</td>\n<td>跨时区/OS 失败</td>\n<td><code>Date.now()</code> / 随机数调用</td>\n<td>mock 环境依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"理解-flaky-测试的根因分类\">理解 Flaky 测试的根因分类</h2><p>Flaky 测试的所有根因可以归纳为三大类：</p>\n<h3 id=\"第一类-时序依赖-timing-dependencies\">第一类：时序依赖（Timing Dependencies）</h3><p><strong>特征</strong>：测试在本地快机器上通过，在 CI 慢机器上失败；或者时而通过时而失败，没有规律。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 典型 Flaky：没有正确等待异步操作完成&#10;it(&#39;should display loading spinner then results&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;  renderComponent();&#10;  expect(screen.getByTestId(&#39;spinner&#39;)).toBeInTheDocument(); // 可能已经消失了&#10;&#10;  // 固定等待时间是反模式：机器快时 API 还没返回，机器慢时等待不够&#10;  await new Promise((resolve) =&gt; setTimeout(resolve, 100));&#10;&#10;  expect(screen.queryByTestId(&#39;spinner&#39;)).not.toBeInTheDocument();&#10;  expect(screen.getByTestId(&#39;results&#39;)).toBeInTheDocument();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 典型 Flaky：没有正确等待异步操作完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'should display loading spinner then results'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  renderComponent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(screen.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getByTestId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'spinner'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeInTheDocument</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 可能已经消失了</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 固定等待时间是反模式：机器快时 API 还没返回，机器慢时等待不够</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resolve, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(screen.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">queryByTestId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'spinner'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).not.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeInTheDocument</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(screen.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getByTestId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'results'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeInTheDocument</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>修复原则</strong>：用<strong>确定性等待</strong>（等待特定状态）替代<strong>时间等待</strong>（sleep N 毫秒）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 修复后：等待具体的 DOM 状态变化&#10;it(&#39;should display loading spinner then results&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;  renderComponent();&#10;&#10;  // 等待 spinner 出现（确认初始状态）&#10;  expect(await screen.findByTestId(&#39;spinner&#39;)).toBeInTheDocument();&#10;&#10;  // 等待 spinner 消失（不关心等多久，只关心结果）&#10;  await waitForElementToBeRemoved(() =&gt; screen.queryByTestId(&#39;spinner&#39;));&#10;&#10;  // 现在 results 肯定在了&#10;  expect(screen.getByTestId(&#39;results&#39;)).toBeInTheDocument();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 修复后：等待具体的 DOM 状态变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'should display loading spinner then results'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  renderComponent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 等待 spinner 出现（确认初始状态）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> screen.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findByTestId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'spinner'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeInTheDocument</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 等待 spinner 消失（不关心等多久，只关心结果）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> waitForElementToBeRemoved</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> screen.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">queryByTestId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'spinner'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 现在 results 肯定在了</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(screen.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getByTestId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'results'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeInTheDocument</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"第二类-顺序依赖-order-dependencies\">第二类：顺序依赖（Order Dependencies）</h3><p><strong>特征</strong>：单独运行一个测试通过，但在整个测试文件或套件里运行时失败；在不同顺序下结果不一致。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 根因：测试之间共享了可变的全局状态&#10;let database: TestDatabase;&#10;&#10;// Test A（先运行）&#10;it(&#39;test A&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;  database = await TestDatabase.create();&#10;  await database.seed(&#39;user&#39;, { id: 1, name: &#39;Alice&#39; });&#10;  const users = await UserService.findAll();&#10;  expect(users).toHaveLength(1);&#10;});&#10;&#10;// Test B（后运行，但依赖 Test A 的 database 变量）&#10;it(&#39;test B&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;  // 如果 Test B 单独运行，database 是 undefined&#10;  await database.seed(&#39;user&#39;, { id: 2, name: &#39;Bob&#39; });&#10;  const users = await UserService.findAll();&#10;  // 如果 Test A 先跑，这里有 2 个用户&#10;  // 如果 Test B 先跑，这里 crash 因为 database 是 undefined&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 根因：测试之间共享了可变的全局状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> database</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TestDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Test A（先运行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'test A'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F9